    "teaserText": "",
    "startText": "[shouting] \"Stick together!\" said one.\n\n[determined] \"Watch each other's backs!\" added the other.\n\n[focused] Anthony nodded. [thinking]Perhaps those midnight tactics they'd perfected at the tavern will come in handy... wait... what did I have todo first?",
